url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108438","id":3053751953,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62BI6R","user":{"login":"KaterynaKateryna","id":13875086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODc1MDg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13875086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna","html_url":"https://github.com/KaterynaKateryna","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-09T19:22:58Z","updated_at":"2025-07-09T19:22:58Z","body":"Thank you @syntaxerror247, the change looks like it should solve my issue, but I have trouble exporting the build with the editor from the PR artifacts.\n\nThis is what I did: \n- downloaded windows-editor and android-template-arm64 from the artifacts of the PR\n- launched the editor and opened my project\n- deleted res://android folder locally\n- Installed android-template-arm64 by following Project -> Install Android Build Template -> Install from file -> android_source.zip\n- Tried to export my project by going to Project -> Export Project\n\nThe first error I got was \"mipmap/icon_background not found\". So I set launcher_icons/adaptive_background_432x432 which was empty before. \n\nThen I got this error:\n\n<img width=\"1905\" height=\"1132\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e29b07a5-0982-47ed-af39-db2e1c2fcef0\" />\n\nOn the good side, when I look into themes.xml, android:windowSplashScreenBackground is set to the right colour. Now I just need the android build to succeed :) \nCan you help me understand what I am doing wrong.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3053751953/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3053770797","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108438#issuecomment-3053770797","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108438","id":3053770797,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62BNgt","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-09T19:31:19Z","updated_at":"2025-07-09T19:36:04Z","body":"@KaterynaKateryn