earlier builds I did from 4.4.1.stable and 4.5.beta2. I don't think I changed anything in the export_precets.cfg, so the only difference is the editor and the export template.\n\nNot sure what's the issue then. My only guess is that maybe you downloaded the wrong template like arm32 instead of arm64. I'd say to wait for beta 4 and if issue persists please open a bug report.\n\nCC @m4gr3d \n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3054040453/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3054071221","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108438#issuecomment-3054071221","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108438","id":3054071221,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62CW21","user":{"login":"KaterynaKateryna","id":13875086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODc1MDg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13875086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna","html_url":"https://github.com/KaterynaKateryna","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaterynaKateryna/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-09T21:15:49Z","updated_at":"2025-07-09T21:15:49Z","body":"thank you for your help @syntaxerror247\nI'll definitely check in beta4","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3054071221/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3054125190","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108438#issuecomment-3054125190","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108438","id":3054125190,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62CkCG","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-09T21:32:07Z","updated_at":"2025-07-09T21:32:07Z","body":"Yeah I also think it's likely you downloaded the wrong arch version, as that is one of the reasons this warning shows.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3054125190/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5237295472","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108438#issuecomment-5237295472","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108438","id":5237295472,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOCrJcA","user":{"login":"rajastya","id":202750296,"node_id":"U_kgDODBW5WA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202750296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya","html_url":"https://github.com/rajastya","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T07:44:23Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T13:55:28Z","body":"In case anyone still wondering, remove the \"android:\" part if you are using newer latest Godot version. So it will be like:\n\n**[splash]windowSplashScreenBackground** = #RRGGBBAA <- your hex value\n\nThis **[splash]android:windowSplashScreenBackground** won't give any change.\n\n---\n\nSame thing for:\n\n**[splash]windowSplashScreenAnimatedIcon** = **@path/your_icon** OR  **@android:color/transparent** <- can't use hex\n\n---\n\nNow your initial, Android splash screen that runs before the engine's splash screen, will change its color. Not just white or black, any color you want.\n\nYou can also use **@android:color/white** OR **@android:color/black** OR **@android:color/transparent** instead of **#RRGGBBAA** hex value.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5237295472/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5237370100","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108438#issuecomment-5237370100","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108438","id":5237370100,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOCvs9A","user":{"login":"rajastya","id":202750296,"node_id":"U_kgDODBW5WA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202750296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya","html_url":"https://github.com/rajastya","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajastya/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T07:52:29Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T13:58:44Z","body":"You might also want to add:\n\n**android:windowBackground** = #RRGGBBAA\n\n---\n\nI'm not sure myself, but I think this one above only works for older Android version. So you might want to add both versions in every project for consistency, like:\n\n1. **android:windowBackground** = #FF4800 (orange color, for older Android)\n2. **[splash]windowSplashScreenBackground** = #FF4800 (orange color, for newer Android)\n3. anything else you want to add","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5237370100/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5237911174","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108438#issuecomment-5237911174","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108438","id":5237911174,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABODQuhg","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T08:44:50Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T08:46:18Z","body":"BTW you can now also use these Advance export options (added in Godot 4.7)\n\n<img width=\"1160\" height=\"725\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7d25253e-0ef3-4e0b-a7ce-9d3b76be213d\" />","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5237911174/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]